  <!-- EN: skin implant - Mythril -->
  <OE_ImplantSkin_Mythril.label>皮肤植入体 - 秘银</OE_ImplantSkin_Mythril.label>
  <!-- EN: Obsidia skin implant releases chemicals and nanomachines that toughen the skin and add flexible subdermal mythril plates at strategic points. This makes the user more resistant to damage across their whole body. -->
  <OE_ImplantSkin_Mythril.description>黑曜石皮肤植入体会释放化学物质和纳米机器，强化皮肤并在关键点添加柔性的皮下秘银板。这使得使用者全身对伤害更具抵抗力。</OE_ImplantSkin_Mythril.description>
  
